<title>LATVIA: UNIBANKA SHAREHOLDERS' MEETING AGENDA.</title>
<headline>UNIBANKA SHAREHOLDERS' MEETING AGENDA.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading Latvian bank Unibanka holds its shareholder meeting on Tuesday. Here are the main points on the agenda:</p>
<p>- A review of the 1996 report.</p>
<p>- The division of Unibanka's 1996 profit.</p>
<p>- Unibanka 1997 budget and activity plan.</p>
<p>- Vote on the auditor for Unibanka in 1997.</p>
<p>- The increase of Unibanka basic capital and corresponding changes in statutes.</p>
<p>- The issue of joining stock company Zemes Banka to Unibanka.</p>
<p>The registration of shareholders started at 0800/0600 GMT at the World Trade Centre at Elizabetes 2.</p>
<p>Some 16.632 million lats of Unibanka shares of its total share capital of 19.914 million lats were blocked before the meeting allowing these people to take part in the meeting.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
